{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ab06c39470b966d2ce4441babf0e032c.webp?t=1754552819\" width=610 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> is an award-winning VR first-person shooter for the whole family. Winner of <strong>Best XR/VR</strong> at <strong>Gamescom Latam Big Festival 2025</strong>, it takes you to the vibrant Sugar Kingdom, where you play as the Sugar Prince on a mission to save a cherished friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore a Sweet Kingdom Full of Action</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i>, you enter a world full of sweets, surprises, and shooting challenges. Whether it\u2019s blasting through tricky foes or fighting mighty bosses, the shooter mechanics are designed to be fun, lighthearted, and non-violent, making it a great experience for families to enjoy together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Experience Different Kinds of Shooting Levels</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you\u2019ll be firing at waves of enemies; the next, you\u2019re speeding along a mine cart rail, adding an extra burst of excitement and challenge to your shooting journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Get Creative with Various Weapons</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s a hero without the right tools? You\u2019ll have access to a range of weapons that help you take down the attacking cakes and bosses. Each one adds a bit of fun variety, letting you experiment and find the best fit for your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Take on Unforgettable Boss Battles</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go deeper into the Sugar Kingdom, you\u2019ll face powerful bosses, each with their own attack patterns and mechanics. These fights are where you\u2019ll really get to test your skills and adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Test Yourself in Nightmare Mode</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something tougher? <i>Nightmare Mode</i> offers 10 extra hard levels designed for experienced players who want to push their abilities even further. It\u2019s the perfect way to extend your adventure once you\u2019ve mastered the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore Puzzles, Rhythm Challenges, and More</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> is not just about shooting. It mixes things up with puzzle levels, rhythm-based trials, and fun mini-games. It\u2019s a colorful arcade blend where there's always something new to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Collect Achievements and Complete Your Journey</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you can unlock a variety of achievements that mark your progress. For those of you who love 100% completion, there\u2019s plenty here to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its family-friendly approach, fun shooter mechanics, creative levels, and engaging challenges, <i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> offers a VR experience that\u2019s easy to pick up, fun to play, and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your headset, jump in, and start your adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Full arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/c35bdca7b95c9fd368d1069fbb0d7c3fe67d74be.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/0d738068f350c2866e12a25108cecdd3b06db810.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow of the Titan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/39e5734d2b14fa4332321485a7bfc25a400b150c.jpg"},{"name":"Pastry Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/9d736051601e43633286cbb83d90a245ae9346cf.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet teeth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/7eeaeea073baf239f864d7537861c973e84fbcf0.jpg"},{"name":"The arcade King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/ae09d5002158739586606fb389db0383c32cf363.jpg"},{"name":"Handyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/dae06e8b9ebbe1e55bd8a3f8c988cbc399992cba.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/d36d0f2ccea2f2a362e29077cfd485333dd72c23.jpg"},{"name":"Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/e5a5a313349cbb929778973209af19515c07455d.jpg"},{"name":"Prince of the Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480010/476aae89c12a5e1814190617f82cb23cf9f65be3.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2480010?t=1754552819","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/6c6984b7eb9f0048a15405f888d784fc9e869ff0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754552819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/938748bf243d6039c4e6559b6d1157bac3eae47c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754552819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/938748bf243d6039c4e6559b6d1157bac3eae47c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754552819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2597510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ab06c39470b966d2ce4441babf0e032c.webp?t=1754552819\" width=610 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> is an award-winning VR first-person shooter for the whole family. Winner of <strong>Best XR/VR</strong> at <strong>Gamescom Latam Big Festival 2025</strong>, it takes you to the vibrant Sugar Kingdom, where you play as the Sugar Prince on a mission to save a cherished friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore a Sweet Kingdom Full of Action</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i>, you enter a world full of sweets, surprises, and shooting challenges. Whether it\u2019s blasting through tricky foes or fighting mighty bosses, the shooter mechanics are designed to be fun, lighthearted, and non-violent, making it a great experience for families to enjoy together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Experience Different Kinds of Shooting Levels</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you\u2019ll be firing at waves of enemies; the next, you\u2019re speeding along a mine cart rail, adding an extra burst of excitement and challenge to your shooting journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/57c1cd6bf7ebc9d576a1434e04121cf5.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Get Creative with Various Weapons</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s a hero without the right tools? You\u2019ll have access to a range of weapons that help you take down the attacking cakes and bosses. Each one adds a bit of fun variety, letting you experiment and find the best fit for your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/68b5486e8bf3b85cd171087ee47a44ed.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Take on Unforgettable Boss Battles</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go deeper into the Sugar Kingdom, you\u2019ll face powerful bosses, each with their own attack patterns and mechanics. These fights are where you\u2019ll really get to test your skills and adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/b91410c48d2de23c5ecba4cd7e0c2988.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Test Yourself in Nightmare Mode</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something tougher? <i>Nightmare Mode</i> offers 10 extra hard levels designed for experienced players who want to push their abilities even further. It\u2019s the perfect way to extend your adventure once you\u2019ve mastered the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/fe145620616bef00333e84a3582a6d2f.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore Puzzles, Rhythm Challenges, and More</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> is not just about shooting. It mixes things up with puzzle levels, rhythm-based trials, and fun mini-games. It\u2019s a colorful arcade blend where there's always something new to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.poster.avif?t=1754552819\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.webm?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480010/extras/ac0196bd6ddb95dda046eef919795def.mp4?t=1754552819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Collect Achievements and Complete Your Journey</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you can unlock a variety of achievements that mark your progress. For those of you who love 100% completion, there\u2019s plenty here to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its family-friendly approach, fun shooter mechanics, creative levels, and engaging challenges, <i>Sugar Mess \u2013 Let\u2019s Play Jolly Battle</i> offers a VR experience that\u2019s easy to pick up, fun to play, and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your headset, jump in, and start your adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers"